    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can provide personalized tutoring, explain concepts in different ways, and offer practice problems tailored to a student’s level. They can help students explore different solution paths and understand the reasoning behind answers. This can make math learning more engaging and less intimidating, especially for those who struggle with traditional methods."
